igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14v95.jpg"}, {"id": 1906749, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14v99.jpg"}, {"id": 1906747, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14v97.jpg"}, {"id": 1906748, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc14v98.jpg"}, {"id": 1626532, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scyv1g.jpg"}, {"id": 1626533, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scyv1h.jpg"}, {"id": 1626534, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scyv1i.jpg"}, {"id": 1626536, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scyv1k.jpg"}, {"id": 1626537, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scyv1l.jpg"}], "slug": "ragnarok-the-new-world", "storyline": "In a land where myths and legends come to life, the gates of Midgard stand open once again.\nAs an adventurer, you set out on a boundless journey across lively towns, endless fields, and mysterious dungeons. From the bustling streets of Prontera to the untamed frontiers where mighty monsters roam, every step leads to new allies, fierce battles, and unforgettable memories.\n\nBut Ragnarok: The New World has always been more than just combat\u2014it is a tale of friendship, discovery, and the courage to face the unknown.\nIn Ragnarok: The New World, the adventure never truly ends. Choose your class, forge your path, rally your guild, and carve your own legend in a living, breathing MMORPG world.", "summary": "Ragnarok: The New World is a massive online role-playing adventure set in the legendary world of Midgard. Explore vast fields, bustling cities, and mysterious dungeons where every journey holds new challenges and stories.\n\nCreate your own character and choose from classic jobs such as Swordsman, Mage, Archer, and Merchant. Customize your appearance with a wide variety of outfits, raise pets, ride mounts, and truly express yourself in a vibrant open world.\n\nBeyond combat, build and decorate your own home\u2014design a personal sanctuary to relax, gather with friends, and show off your creativity.\n\nJoin forces with allies to defeat powerful bosses, tackle dangerous raids, and grow together in guilds and communities. Or simply wander freely, trade, and enjoy the world at your own pace. With nostalgia and freedom at its core, Ragnarok: The New World invites you to relive the spirit of Ragnarok while writing your own legend in an ever-evolving online world.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ragnarok-the-new-world", "videos": [{"id": 167745, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "KVHa83JkUV0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KVHa83JkUV0", "title": "Ragnarok: The New World\uff5cFirst Global Full Gameplay Trailer Released", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/KVHa83JkUV0/sddefault.jpg"}]}